component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
A01 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "B01\nIdentity/access" as B01
A01 ..> B01 : contract / port
component "B02\nHome/consent" as B02
A01 ..> B02 : contract / port
component "B06\nFleet/config" as B06
A01 ..> B06 : contract / port
note bottom of A01
Flow: Require home/timezone/resident consent/distinct caregiver pair; construct idempotent home command; require every enabled input plus hub controls and real delivery drill.
